OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,8,FThis Saturday BBC Four will devote its
OL,9,Fentire evening to celebrating the
OL,10,Fcareer of Angela Rippon.
OL,12,FFrom the original Top Gear to Come
OL,13,FDancing through to Rip-Off Britain, her
OL,14,Fachievements are huge.
OL,16,FBut, of course, her greatest
OL,17,Fachievement is the one which earned her
OL,18,Fa place in broadcasting history. Angela
OL,19,Fwas the first woman to become
OL,20,Festablished as a network newsreader.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
