OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngela initially presented the News on
OL,7,F2 and was tried out on the main BBC One
OL,8,Fbulletins in 1975.
OL,10,FShe succeeded and became a regular BBC
OL,11,FOne newsreader the following year.
OL,13,FIf was not by chance that she presented
OL,14,Fall three bulletins on the day they
OL,15,Fwere relaunched in March 1976.
OL,17,FAll this should be seen in the context
OL,18,Fof the time.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
