OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Equal Pay Act and the Sex
OL,7,FDiscrimination Act both became law in
OL,8,F1975.
OL,10,FMargaret Thatcher was the Leader of the
OL,11,FOpposition and a woman Prime Minister
OL,12,Fwas a real possibility.
OL,14,FThe idea that a woman could not read
OL,15,Fthe news would simply have looked
OL,16,Fsexist by then even if, undoubtedly,
OL,17,Fthere would have been dinosaurs in the
OL,18,Fnewsroom who did not like the thought.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
