OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome were tried out on attachment ` but
OL,7,Fmostly filled the daytime shifts, often
OL,8,Fon BBC Two where they had little to do
OL,9,Fapart from read the Service Information
OL,10,Fbulletin and link into Play School.
OL,12,FReportedly complaints were received
OL,13,Fwhen women were heard on the evening
OL,14,Fshifts:
OL,16,FIt is astounding to think of viewers
OL,17,Fobjecting to a woman announcer yet, by
OL,18,Fimplication, accepting a woman
OL,19,Fnewsreader.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13308
SC,0008
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F133A1768760744
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would be sad to think of
OL,7,FPresentation listening to such
OL,8,Fcomplaints when, it would seem the news
OL,9,Fand current affairs departments would
OL,10,Fhave dismissed any suggestions that
OL,11,Fwomen were unsuitable for high-profile
OL,12,Froles.
OL,14,FLet's face it ` reading the Nine
OL,15,Fo'Clock News or presenting Nationwide
OL,16,Fwas far more important than continuity
OL,17,Fannouncing.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,134,120,200,300,0,100
