OL,3,GFEATURES CNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday a huge variety of voices are
OL,7,Fconsidered suitable for Presentation `
OL,8,Fa strong accent or what some would
OL,9,Fconsider bad diction are not
OL,10,Fnecessarily barriers, in the name of
OL,11,Fdiversity.
OL,13,FSo it is worth reflecting on the fact
OL,14,Fthat there were few women announcers on
OL,15,Fthe BBC networks for many years even
OL,16,Fwhile women like Angela Rippon were
OL,17,Fsmashing glass ceilings in much more
OL,18,Fprominent and important roles.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
